            "lead": "",
            "gvm_label": "GVM increase",
            "gvm": "",
            "rows": "Lift Height | 3 Inches\nTyre Size | Engineered for either 35-inch or 37-inch tyres.\nSuspension Tech | Utilises a comprehensive BDS 3\" Kit, which includes a differential drop, sway bar relocation, and a rear block kit to dial in a perfectly level ride.\nShock Configuration | Fox 2.5 Performance Elite Series Shocks (front and rear) featuring remote reservoirs and adjustable damping. You can literally dial in the ride with a simple clicker—soften it up for the highway, or firm it up for the tracks.\nExtras | We also include colour-coded Husky Extenda Flares and ORI Metal mud flap brackets with rubber to ensure your vehicle is completely compliant and federally approved.\nWhat's Not Included | Just your wheels and tyres! All you need to do is pick your style. We have already set the specific wheel offsets required to keep the build federally compliant, so there is no need to stress about load ratings or legality.",
            "features": "",
