            "lead": "",
            "gvm_label": "GVM increase",
            "gvm": "",
            "rows": "Lift Height | 3 Inches\nTyre Size | Engineered for either 35-inch or 37-inch tyres.\nSuspension Tech | Utilises a comprehensive BDS 3\" Coilover Kit that features a complete torsion bar delete—the ultimate key to a smoother ride. This system includes premium front coilovers, heavy-duty tie rods, upgraded upper and lower control arms, and a rear block kit to dial in a perfectly level stance.\nShock Configuration | Massive Fox 2.5 Performance Elite Series Shocks (front coilovers and rear shocks) featuring remote reservoirs and adjustable damping. You can literally dial in your comfort with a simple clicker—soften it up to float down the highway, or firm it up for off-road tracks and towing.\nExtras | We also include colour-coded Husky Extenda Flares and ORI Metal mud flap brackets with rubber to ensure your vehicle is completely compliant and federally approved.\nWhat's Not Included | Just your wheels and tyres! All you need to do is pick your style. We have already set the specific wheel offsets required to keep the build federally compliant, so there is no need to stress about load ratings or legality.",
            "features": "",
            "best_for": "The owner who demands the absolute best ride quality possible. If you want to upgrade to a plush coilover front end but are concerned about engineering and compliance, this is your solution. The ORI Stage 3 package fully engineers the BDS Coilover conversion for your Chevy Silverado 2500HD, eliminating the harsh factory ride.",
            "benefit": "",
