        "stage_4": {
          "type": "stage",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Stage 4",
            "tab_meta": "5\" lift · $21,999*",
            "acc_meta": "The Outlaw 5\" Legal Monster · 5\" lift · $21,999*",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Stage_4_Chevy2500.png",
            "eyebrow": "$21,999* · Installed & engineered",
            "title": "The Outlaw 5\" Legal Monster",
            "subtitle": "",
            "lead": "",
            "gvm_label": "GVM increase",
            "gvm": "",
            "rows": "Lift Height | 5 Inches\nTyre Size | Engineered specifically for 37-inch tyres.\nSuspension Tech | Utilises a heavy-duty BDS 5\" High-Clearance Kit, featuring a full replacement subframe drop and upgraded replacement steering knuckles to keep your factory steering geometry perfectly intact at the 5-inch ride height. ORI also includes the premium BDS upper control arms to give the front end a completely integrated, high-end look.\nShock Configuration | Fox 2.5 Performance Elite Series Shocks (front and rear) featuring remote reservoirs and adjustable damping. You can literally dial in the ride with a simple clicker—soften it up for a plush highway cruise, or firm it up for control on the tracks.\nExtras | We also include colour-coded Husky Extenda Flares and ORI Metal mud flap brackets with rubber to ensure your vehicle is completely compliant and federally approved.\nWhat's Not Included | Just your wheels and tyres! All you need to do is pick your style. We have already set the specific wheel offsets required to keep the build federally compliant, so there is no need to stress about load ratings or legality.",
            "features": "",
